{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55452","headline":"拟寒山 九 · 泰钦","name":"拟寒山 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自住国清寺，因循经几年。\n不穷三藏教，匪学祖师禅。\n一事攻烧火，余闲任性眠。\n生涯何所有？今古与人传。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"泰钦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55452.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55452","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}